just ascended a healer for the first time yesterday, and magic missile
worked wonders. So either blank out and write a magic missle book, or
try breaking statues or polypiling for any attack spell. Also I didn't
use a unicorn horn, what I would do is kill a long worm and make a
crysknife, (enchant weapon on the worm tooth FYI) your healer probably
already has some skill with knives from the beginning and I found a
fully enchanted crysknife and a fully enchanted staff of aesculapius
worked about equally. It will also make a great back-up weapon for
when Rodney or a demon steals your quest artifact, so it won't be a
waste of enchant weapon scrolls. As for quest spoilers, I would
